<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="hero">
  <h1>The right crew for the shoot. The right shoot for the crew.</h1>
  <p class="lead">CrewMatch matches camera, grip, electric, sound, art, post and every other department with productions that need them. Crew join free, forever.</p>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>I'm crew</h2>
      <p>Build your profile once: roles, skills, gear, rates and when you're free. We show you jobs that fit.</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="/crew/signup">Join as crew, free</a></p>
      <p class="muted">Already a member? <a href="/crew/login">Log in</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>I'm a production</h2>
      <p>Post a project with dates, location and positions. Get a short list of suitable, available crew for each position.</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="/production/signup">Sign up as a production</a></p>
      <p class="muted">Already registered? <a href="/production/login">Log in</a> · <a href="/pricing">See pricing</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="card">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Crew fill in their profile and availability calendar.</li>
    <li>Productions post a project and the positions they need.</li>
    <li>CrewMatch suggests a short, ordered list of crew for each position, and shows crew the jobs that fit them.</li>
    <li>The production sends an offer. The crew member accepts or declines.</li>
    <li>After the job, <strong>both sides confirm it happened</strong>. Only then does it count on the crew member's record.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
